The cache, RoPE, HF execution/training, compatibility, fingerprint and validation
implementations were moved from the bundled KV Packet library into this shared
backend. Packet APIs re-export these same definitions; EPIC and recomputation
baselines use them directly, without importing a KV Packet method or wrapper.
Selective recomputation adapts the baseline decoder equations to the same cache
types, native token IDs, current HF APIs and the KVBench TTFT/output contracts.
Benchmark/data/metric/evaluation code and external module-path injection omitted.
